Hawa Mahal, City Palace and Jantar Mantar are a few minutes apart, so you can do them together on foot. Want me to plan this as a one-day route?

India's real GDP growth over the last 5 years ran between 6.5% and 9.7%, with the peak in FY2021-22 as the economy bounced back after Covid. These are approximate figures from memory, and FY2025-26 is an early estimate, so check MoSPI for the final numbers.

